Heart: Oh... oh no... what have I done? Why wasn't I  more careful?! I shouldn't have listened to Mind. I should've known this was a trap!

<<pan Camera Down>>   

Heart: I need to get out of here. I need to find Mind. I can't let them down. I can't let <b> myself <b> down. That tunnel has to let out somewhere. //make myself bold

<<pan Camera Right>> //have camera move at speed of 4.2

Heart: I just need to keep moving. I can do this. I can get out of here. I can find Mind. I can save them.

Heart: That memento... what caused it to make the floor collapse? Think man, think!

<<wait  5>>

Heart: I remember now... it was the heartbreak from the memory inside the rose. It must have what have weakened the floor to the point of breaking... is everything here a metaphor?! 

<<wait 3>>

Heart: ...

Heart: Nevermind. Right now, I have to find a way to Mind.
